{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217810","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217810","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1621781001:1":{"text":"방금 누가 콧노래 불렀어? 되게 잘 불렀는데...","source_cn":"刚刚是谁在哼歌呀，还挺好听的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA9548972DC7C9B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621781002:1":{"text":"난 아니야! 리온도 아닐걸? 리온은 노래 부르면 오리가 우는 거 같다고.","source_cn":"不是我，肯定也不是利奥。利奥唱歌像是鸭子叫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EACF98B1144C45A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621781003:1":{"text":"야! 레이먼드!","source_cn":"雷蒙德——！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85BF2A7550645097","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621781004:1":{"text":"그게... 내가 한 거야. 기분이 좋아서... 내 노래는 들어줄 게 못 되거든. 너무 신경 쓰지 마.","source_cn":"那个，其实是我随便哼的，因为心情很好……我唱歌不太好听...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC26260040FD7A5B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621781005:0":{"text":"아니에요. 엄청 듣기 좋았어요. 또 불러줘요!","source_cn":"没有啊，很好听的！再唱一段，唱一段！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA4786F03FA4B669","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_titl